WEBVTT

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.375
Here are today's news topics.

00:00:33.375 --> 00:00:35.375
<i>When I awoke...</i>

00:00:36.917 --> 00:00:40.375
<i>...I found myself in yet another jam.</i>

00:00:52.083 --> 00:00:57.917
<i>They're increasing.</i>
<i>The mythical beings are increasing!</i>

00:00:58.042 --> 00:01:01.083
<i>I can hear my heart bell</i>

00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:03.667
<i>What could it mean?</i>

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:07.375
<i>A bell in my heart is ringing</i>

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:13.000
"Heaven's Lost Property"

00:01:13.167 --> 00:01:18.917
<i>It all started way back then </i>
<i>(ringin' ringin')</i>

00:01:18.917 --> 00:01:24.500
<i>Ever since before we were born</i>
<i>(ringin' ringin')</i>

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:29.750
<i>you were destined to appear out of nowhere,</i>

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:32.750
<i>right before my eyes,</i>

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:35.542
<i>I'm sure of it</i>

00:01:35.542 --> 00:01:41.208
<i>My wishes and ambitions and daydreams</i>

00:01:41.208 --> 00:01:46.875
<i>take me to an unknown level and knock on a door</i>

00:01:46.875 --> 00:01:53.083
<i>You give me the key and the future</i>
<i>I need to take flight (with your wings)</i>

00:01:53.083 --> 00:01:56.000
<i>I can hear my heart bell</i>

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:59.042
<i>There's no stopping it</i>

00:01:59.042 --> 00:02:04.708
<i>It's a sign, rung by an angel, saying "I love you"</i>

00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:07.583
<i>Can you hear my heart bell?</i>

00:02:07.583 --> 00:02:09.917
<i>What could it mean?</i>

00:02:09.917 --> 00:02:15.333
<i>A bell in my heart that I've </i>
<i>never heard before is ringing</i>

00:02:15.333 --> 00:02:24.458
<i>But even so, you don't suspect a thing</i>

00:02:30.833 --> 00:02:33.458
"Closed for trip to the beach"
"--New World Discovery Club"

00:02:34.792 --> 00:02:37.417
"Swimsuit Surf Brigade, Go! Go! Go!"

00:02:37.458 --> 00:02:39.125
Good morning!

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:41.875
It looks like it's going to
be another hot one in Fukuoka.

00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:44.083
Get your sun parasols ready,

00:02:44.083 --> 00:02:47.333
and please don't forget to take
precautions against heat stroke.

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:49.000
Hey, Ikaros...

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.500
Yes, Master?

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:53.750
Friend of yours? Is that girl a friend of yours?

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:55.083
I do not know.

00:02:55.083 --> 00:02:57.583
But however you look at it,
she's one of your kind, isn't she?!

00:02:57.583 --> 00:03:00.042
She has wings like you do, and that collar.

00:03:00.042 --> 00:03:02.167
You listen to me!
Don't go turning my house

00:03:02.167 --> 00:03:04.083
into a rendezvous point
for mythical beings!

00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:05.167
Um...

00:03:05.167 --> 00:03:07.167
Hey there, bug...

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:16.167
<i>I hope I didn't hear that right.</i>

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.458
Um, what did you just call me?

00:03:19.458 --> 00:03:21.542
If I called you a bug,
then that's what you are.

00:03:21.542 --> 00:03:23.708
Is there anyone else here?

00:03:23.708 --> 00:03:25.792
Indeed.

00:03:27.292 --> 00:03:32.042
Listen, Ikaros, my motto is
"Nothing beats peace and quiet."

00:03:32.042 --> 00:03:36.125
You're all I can handle,
all by yourself. Do you understand?

00:03:36.125 --> 00:03:37.750
Yes, Master.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:40.875
Then have her leave here immediately!

00:03:40.875 --> 00:03:44.583
I won't have my daily life disrupted any more!

00:03:44.583 --> 00:03:48.083
There's always something
going on at Sakurai's house, huh?

00:03:48.083 --> 00:03:50.375
Sounds like something else has happened.

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:55.750
Why did you bring her along?

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.667
Oh, where's the harm?

00:03:57.667 --> 00:04:00.708
The more, the merrier, after all.

00:04:00.708 --> 00:04:03.042
That's not what's at issue here.

00:04:03.042 --> 00:04:08.167
<i>I was supposed to go to the sea with just Tomo.</i>

00:04:13.208 --> 00:04:18.917
We have a winner! First prize is
a one-day trip for two to the beach!

00:04:18.917 --> 00:04:20.750
Hooray!

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:23.292
Here you go. Congratulations.

00:04:23.292 --> 00:04:24.708
This is great, Tomo!

00:04:24.708 --> 00:04:28.125
We haven't been on a trip
together since we were children.

00:04:28.125 --> 00:04:30.250
If you play that much, of course you'll win.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:32.500
I can't wait for this!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.958
I'm so happy! Just you and me, Tomo!

00:04:34.958 --> 00:04:37.875
Congratulations.
The two of you have both won

00:04:37.875 --> 00:04:41.542
a one-day trip for two to the beach!

00:04:41.542 --> 00:04:43.167
Unbelievable!

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:50.542
Sorry, Mitsuki.

00:04:50.542 --> 00:04:52.542
Huh? About what?

00:04:52.542 --> 00:04:56.208
Oh, this was supposed to
be a trip for just you and Tomoki.

00:04:56.208 --> 00:04:59.708
Oh, not at all, Sugata. It's quite all right.

00:05:00.667 --> 00:05:04.333
<i>He's right.</i>
<i>I can't go on pouting about this.</i>

00:05:04.333 --> 00:05:05.542
<i>--We still get to go to the beach.</i>

00:05:05.542 --> 00:05:08.000
--And what is your name?
<i>--We still get to go to the beach.</i>

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.208
Nymph.

00:05:09.208 --> 00:05:12.042
Oh, your name is Nymph?

00:05:12.042 --> 00:05:15.708
Oh, right! I made us some
<i>onigiri </i>for breakfast.

00:05:16.917 --> 00:05:18.333
See?

00:05:19.667 --> 00:05:21.000
Here.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:23.500
Hmm... this one.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.500
But why would there
be another Angeloid <i>now</i>?

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:28.542
They're increasing!
When I got up this morning,

00:05:28.542 --> 00:05:29.833
--she was making herself at home, in my living room!

00:05:29.833 --> 00:05:30.833
--Nymph, it's so pretty how your wings shine like a rainbow.
--she was making herself at home, in my living room!

00:05:30.833 --> 00:05:33.292
--Nymph, it's so pretty how your wings shine like a rainbow.
--Could she be another lead to the New World?

00:05:33.292 --> 00:05:34.125
--They're not at all like Ikaros' wings.

00:05:34.125 --> 00:05:36.500
--Listen to what I'm saying!
--They're not at all like Ikaros' wings.

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:38.708
That's because I'm a
different type than the Alpha.

00:05:38.708 --> 00:05:40.583
Alpha?

00:05:40.583 --> 00:05:44.750
That's her. I'm the successor
model to the Alpha.

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:48.000
The two of you sitting
together look like sisters.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:50.333
--Wow, you're so cute!
--Having two is the same as having one.

00:05:50.333 --> 00:05:51.958
Look after them both.

00:05:51.958 --> 00:05:56.292
It is not the same!
I want my peace and quiet back!

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:01.042
Wow! The ocean!

00:06:01.042 --> 00:06:02.667
The ocean!

00:06:05.125 --> 00:06:08.625
Whoa, hot sand, hot sand!

00:06:08.625 --> 00:06:11.083
Tomo, be careful!

00:06:16.208 --> 00:06:20.083
Did you... bring a swimsuit?

00:06:20.083 --> 00:06:22.667
The chairman arranged it for her.

00:06:22.667 --> 00:06:25.917
Ikaros, where did
the wings on your back go?

00:06:25.917 --> 00:06:30.167
Um, these wings have a variable configuration.

00:06:30.167 --> 00:06:34.000
I am able to make them as small as this.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:37.083
I can make my wings invisible.

00:06:37.083 --> 00:06:39.500
Hmm, that's pretty handy.

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.917
I've arranged for a parasol over there,

00:06:41.917 --> 00:06:44.042
so let's have plenty of fun today.

00:06:44.042 --> 00:06:46.292
Wow, amazing!

00:06:46.292 --> 00:06:48.667
<i>Nymph has me concerned.</i>

00:06:48.667 --> 00:06:51.792
Come on, Eve, we have to hurry,
or we won't make it.

00:06:51.792 --> 00:06:55.583
Mizuki, there is no happiness in Eden.

00:06:55.583 --> 00:06:57.625
<i>I've come all the way to the beach--</i>

00:06:57.625 --> 00:07:00.125
<i>All right, let's play!</i>

00:07:01.125 --> 00:07:02.542
<i>Hai!</i>

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.292
<i>Hai!</i>

00:07:04.292 --> 00:07:08.917
<i>Beach volleyball is as</i>
<i>magnificent a sport as I thought!</i>

00:07:08.917 --> 00:07:12.167
<i>The way Sohara's breasts bounce...</i>

00:07:12.167 --> 00:07:14.708
Tomo! You've got
that horny look in your eye!

00:07:14.708 --> 00:07:17.542
You're imagining it, you're imagining it.

00:07:22.292 --> 00:07:24.250
Nymph, nice attack!

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:25.958
Don't "nice attack" her!

00:07:25.958 --> 00:07:29.250
What are you using your full force for?!
Are you trying to kill me?!

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:31.583
It's your fault for not paying attention.

00:07:31.583 --> 00:07:34.333
Hmph, I didn't do anything wrong.

00:07:34.333 --> 00:07:36.792
Are you all right, Master?

00:07:36.792 --> 00:07:39.042
What is her deal?!

00:07:39.875 --> 00:07:42.083
I'm through with beach volleyball.

00:07:42.083 --> 00:07:44.667
Say, Tomo, let's take a boat out.

00:07:44.667 --> 00:07:46.333
Oh, okay.

00:07:47.458 --> 00:07:48.083
Huh?

00:07:48.083 --> 00:07:48.458
"Curry Eating Contest"

00:07:48.458 --> 00:07:52.333
All right, things have heated up in earnest!

00:07:52.333 --> 00:07:54.125
Sugata!

00:07:54.125 --> 00:07:56.625
Amazing! We have an
amazing young man here!

00:07:56.625 --> 00:08:01.708
--He's starting on his 13th giant bowl of curry!
--Hang in there, Sugata!

00:08:01.708 --> 00:08:03.375
Keep going!

00:08:07.792 --> 00:08:10.292
Never mind, let's leave them be.

00:08:10.292 --> 00:08:14.458
Mm-hmm. Well, I'll go rent us a boat, okay?

00:08:14.458 --> 00:08:15.875
Yeah.

00:08:32.042 --> 00:08:34.042
Here, want one?

00:08:37.958 --> 00:08:41.083
At times like these, you say "thank you."

00:08:41.083 --> 00:08:42.958
Go on, say it.

00:08:42.958 --> 00:08:45.125
Don't give me orders. You're just a bug.

00:08:45.125 --> 00:08:46.958
I-I'm sorry.

00:08:50.042 --> 00:08:52.042
This is delicious!

00:08:52.875 --> 00:08:56.375
What do you know?
You're cute when you smile.

00:08:56.375 --> 00:08:57.542
Don't sit down without asking!

00:08:57.542 --> 00:08:59.042
I'm sorry.

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:06.167
So listen, what are you doing here?

00:09:06.167 --> 00:09:09.000
What am I doing here? Nothing.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:12.167
I just became interested in what
the lower world was like, that's all.

00:09:12.167 --> 00:09:15.333
Oh, by any chance,
did you get worried about Ikaros,

00:09:15.333 --> 00:09:17.208
so you came down to see her?

00:09:17.208 --> 00:09:18.833
She's your friend, right?

00:09:18.833 --> 00:09:23.542
Well, I guess you could say so.
I'm not at all interested in you, though.

00:09:23.542 --> 00:09:25.875
You don't say.

00:09:25.875 --> 00:09:28.792
Speaking of which,
where did Ikaros go?

00:09:31.083 --> 00:09:32.708
Over there.

00:09:49.875 --> 00:09:51.833
See? There she is.

00:09:51.833 --> 00:09:54.292
What is she up to?

00:10:07.083 --> 00:10:10.167
Are you all right, Master?

00:10:10.167 --> 00:10:11.875
There's no reason for you to panic.

00:10:11.875 --> 00:10:16.667
Shallow waters like
these are no problem for Alpha.

00:10:16.667 --> 00:10:19.042
At least float, like normal people!

00:10:19.042 --> 00:10:22.125
What if someone were to see you?!

00:10:22.125 --> 00:10:26.375
But my wings absorb water,
and become heavy,

00:10:26.375 --> 00:10:28.417
so I sink, no matter what.

00:10:28.417 --> 00:10:29.792
That's so stupid.

00:10:29.792 --> 00:10:33.583
You should just keep your
wings out of the water, like me.

00:10:33.583 --> 00:10:34.833
--But they are already wet now.

00:10:34.833 --> 00:10:37.333
<i>--It's no use. If I just leave her to herself,</i>
--But they are already wet now.

00:10:37.333 --> 00:10:39.417
<i>she could create a huge scene.</i>

00:10:39.417 --> 00:10:42.458
<i>I'll teach her how to swim.</i>

00:10:42.458 --> 00:10:45.625
Tomo, I rented a boat!

00:10:45.625 --> 00:10:46.750
Tomo?

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:52.375
No! Extend your legs and kick!
Here, I'll hold your hands.

00:10:52.375 --> 00:10:54.208
Like this, Master?

00:10:54.208 --> 00:10:57.500
I just told you, no!

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:59.125
Tomo...

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:10.208
"Heaven's Lost Property"

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:16.917
Tomo, you idiot!
I even went and rented a boat.

00:11:16.917 --> 00:11:18.875
See if I care!

00:11:24.708 --> 00:11:28.958
I don't know how to swim
either, you know.

00:11:30.417 --> 00:11:33.667
Oh, Sohara, you don't know how to swim?

00:11:33.667 --> 00:11:34.542
Mm-hmm.

00:11:34.542 --> 00:11:37.875
What am I gonna do with you?
I'll hold your hands.

00:11:37.875 --> 00:11:40.333
Come on, give it a try.

00:11:43.708 --> 00:11:46.667
Extend your legs more when you kick.

00:11:46.667 --> 00:11:49.542
Tomo, I'm scared.

00:11:50.375 --> 00:11:53.417
It's okay. I'm right here with you.

00:12:02.125 --> 00:12:05.708
<i>Has he already forgotten?</i>

00:12:06.708 --> 00:12:10.958
Huh? You're kidding, right?
How did I get out this far so fast?

00:12:11.875 --> 00:12:13.958
Oh, no, the oar...

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:18.583
I've been carried away.

00:12:18.583 --> 00:12:20.708
I have to get back.

00:12:25.542 --> 00:12:28.000
All right, one more shot!

00:12:28.958 --> 00:12:32.083
Looks like it's starting
to cloud over a little.

00:12:32.083 --> 00:12:34.125
Huh? Where's Sohara?

00:12:34.125 --> 00:12:35.625
Now that you mention it,

00:12:35.625 --> 00:12:39.667
I saw her all alone
in a boat a little while ago.

00:12:40.792 --> 00:12:45.500
<i>That's right, I told her</i>
<i>I would take it out with her.</i>

00:12:52.083 --> 00:12:54.542
Don't tell me that's her...

00:12:57.167 --> 00:12:58.750
Sohara!

00:13:02.792 --> 00:13:04.792
Sohara!!

00:13:18.125 --> 00:13:19.667
Ah, geez...!

00:13:26.083 --> 00:13:28.000
Incredible...

00:13:34.792 --> 00:13:35.667
What are you...?

00:13:35.667 --> 00:13:38.375
Good grief, you're hopeless.

00:13:42.292 --> 00:13:44.292
<i>I'm done for...</i>

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.833
Sohara!

00:13:59.875 --> 00:14:02.083
Are you all right?

00:14:02.083 --> 00:14:03.583
Tomo...

00:14:04.333 --> 00:14:06.500
and Nymph, too.

00:14:09.292 --> 00:14:10.917
Thank you.

00:14:14.792 --> 00:14:17.500
I'm sorry, Sohara.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.833
I thought that if there was
some commotion raised over Ikaros,

00:14:19.833 --> 00:14:22.583
we wouldn't be able
to have any fun anymore.

00:14:22.583 --> 00:14:26.458
And then, I just got preoccupied.

00:14:26.458 --> 00:14:28.458
I'm really sorry.

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:38.875
But even so, make sure you
never go out to sea by yourself again.

00:14:38.875 --> 00:14:42.875
You never have been able to swim, after all.

00:14:44.375 --> 00:14:48.208
<i>Tomo remembers, after all.</i>

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:53.583
All right, let's get the mood
back and have some fun!

00:14:53.583 --> 00:14:56.833
Then again, the sun is setting.

00:14:56.833 --> 00:14:59.417
I'm sorry, Sohara.

00:14:59.417 --> 00:15:02.292
Mm-mm, it's okay.

00:15:02.292 --> 00:15:04.417
Thanks, Tomo.

00:15:05.917 --> 00:15:08.792
You there, the bug.

00:15:08.792 --> 00:15:10.458
Why are you playing the hero?

00:15:10.458 --> 00:15:13.542
It's because of me that
she was rescued, right?

00:15:13.542 --> 00:15:15.250
Well, yeah, of course.

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:17.458
I still haven't heard any thanks.

00:15:17.458 --> 00:15:19.333
Yeah, sorry.

00:15:19.333 --> 00:15:23.583
Thanks for what you did, Nymph.
Really, you saved the day.

00:15:23.583 --> 00:15:26.292
I'm not hearing any feelings of gratitude.

00:15:27.167 --> 00:15:29.625
What's with you?
For a bug, you've got a lot of nerve.

00:15:29.625 --> 00:15:32.000
Hey, Ikaros, what is
the deal with your friend?!

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:32.875
Um...

00:15:32.875 --> 00:15:35.333
Calling people bugs like that!

00:15:36.208 --> 00:15:38.708
It's about time we started cleaning up.

00:15:38.708 --> 00:15:41.333
Right. Let's do that.

00:15:41.333 --> 00:15:46.125
Okay, Ikaros, let's run through
it a little more, one last time.

00:15:46.125 --> 00:15:47.792
Yes, Master.

00:15:51.875 --> 00:15:54.833
Like I said, extend your legs--

00:15:57.417 --> 00:15:59.583
I'm staying the night.

00:16:00.583 --> 00:16:03.458
No fair! No fair, hanging out with just Ikaros!

00:16:03.458 --> 00:16:05.542
I don't want to go back like this!

00:16:05.542 --> 00:16:07.417
--Stop, Sohara!
--No! No! No!

00:16:07.417 --> 00:16:09.125
I'm staying here! I'm staying,

00:16:09.125 --> 00:16:12.000
--and I'm going to play in the sea tomorrow!
--Don't be crazy!

00:16:12.125 --> 00:16:14.833
"Eating Contest Bonus Prize"
"Seaside Lodging Certificate"

00:16:15.167 --> 00:16:18.875
Seaside Lodging Certificate?

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.583
How is the angel?

00:16:30.792 --> 00:16:33.292
Oh, there's another one of them.

00:16:33.292 --> 00:16:35.833
She doesn't seem to be that bad,

00:16:35.833 --> 00:16:38.833
but having so many of them here...

00:16:40.083 --> 00:16:41.875
...reful...

00:16:42.833 --> 00:16:45.667
Be careful...

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.542
What are you doing here?

00:16:51.542 --> 00:16:52.167
Yes.

00:16:52.167 --> 00:16:53.625
Don't "yes" me!

00:16:53.625 --> 00:16:55.042
Yes.

00:16:55.667 --> 00:16:58.708
You're supposed to be in
the same room as Sohara, right?

00:16:58.708 --> 00:17:01.208
Get back over there and go to bed!

00:17:01.208 --> 00:17:02.958
Um, Master...

00:17:02.958 --> 00:17:04.292
What?

00:17:04.292 --> 00:17:08.708
What is it like to go to sleep?

00:17:08.708 --> 00:17:13.750
We Angeloids were not
created such that we go to sleep,

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:20.792
so I do not know what
it is to sleep, or to dream.

00:17:20.792 --> 00:17:25.875
So what have you been doing
every night while I was asleep?

00:17:25.875 --> 00:17:31.833
I stayed at your side, Master,
all night long, until you woke up.

00:17:38.042 --> 00:17:40.958
All right, I'm awake now.

00:17:43.042 --> 00:17:44.875
Wanna go for a walk out to the sea?

00:17:44.875 --> 00:17:46.125
Master...

00:17:46.125 --> 00:17:49.167
You've kept your wings tucked in,
and they must be cramped, right?

00:17:49.167 --> 00:17:51.750
There won't be anyone down
there at this hour.

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:54.625
You can stretch out your
wings as much as you like.

00:17:55.667 --> 00:17:57.083
Yes.

00:18:05.083 --> 00:18:08.292
<i>Ikaros' specs include a crush depth of 3000,</i>

00:18:08.292 --> 00:18:11.792
<i>and 720 consecutive hours</i>
<i>of oxygen-free activity.</i>

00:18:11.792 --> 00:18:16.000
<i>It is presumed that Nymph</i>
<i>also has equivalent capabilities.</i>

00:18:17.208 --> 00:18:22.875
<i>What would be the point of</i>
<i>another Angeloid coming down, now?</i>

00:18:22.875 --> 00:18:25.042
It's strange, all right.

00:18:30.833 --> 00:18:36.083
<i>It would come in handy,</i>
<i>not being able to sleep. Even so,</i>

00:18:36.083 --> 00:18:41.083
<i>when Ikaros said that,</i>
<i>for some reason, I felt very sorry for her.</i>

00:18:48.458 --> 00:18:53.333
<i>Could she also be spending</i>
<i>a sleepless night right now?</i>

00:18:58.333 --> 00:19:00.083
Master...?

00:19:00.083 --> 00:19:02.000
Are you ready to go back?

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.417
Yes.

00:19:03.875 --> 00:19:06.583
Hey, let go of me, you bugs!

00:19:06.583 --> 00:19:10.250
What? We were just being nice to you.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:11.750
Nymph!

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:22.833
I'm sorry, her language skills
aren't exactly the best.

00:19:22.833 --> 00:19:24.458
Come on, let's go.

00:19:24.458 --> 00:19:27.500
Just a sec. We're not through talking here.

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.958
We were concerned when
we saw a child out all by herself,

00:19:29.958 --> 00:19:31.375
and called over to her...

00:19:31.375 --> 00:19:34.875
Leave me alone!
Stay away from me, you bugs!

00:19:34.875 --> 00:19:35.625
What?!

00:19:35.625 --> 00:19:41.375
Hey! Why is she calling us bugs? Eh?

00:19:41.375 --> 00:19:44.708
What are you doing to my master?

00:19:44.708 --> 00:19:47.542
Huh? W-Wings?!

00:19:49.167 --> 00:19:50.667
Alpha...

00:19:50.667 --> 00:19:55.375
I asked you what you are doing to my master.

00:20:07.875 --> 00:20:09.708
W-What the...?

00:20:13.375 --> 00:20:14.792
Stop.

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:32.875
Stop!!

00:20:44.333 --> 00:20:47.750
That's not who you are, is it?!

00:20:53.958 --> 00:20:55.958
We're going back.

00:21:06.417 --> 00:21:09.250
A pair of angels, huh?

00:21:24.458 --> 00:21:26.875
Say, Ikaros...

00:21:26.875 --> 00:21:27.833
Yes?

00:21:27.833 --> 00:21:31.417
The insides of that watermelon
you've been cradling all this time

00:21:31.417 --> 00:21:34.708
have probably long
since spoiled, and gone mushy.

00:21:40.208 --> 00:21:43.000
You really are better this way.

00:21:44.083 --> 00:21:46.167
I'm sorry I got upset at you last night.

00:21:46.167 --> 00:21:49.375
You were acting like one
of those humanoid weapons,

00:21:49.375 --> 00:21:51.583
like you see in the movies.

00:21:52.792 --> 00:21:56.875
I was just thinking,
that's sort of something I wouldn't like.

00:22:08.542 --> 00:22:11.833
<i>Could it be passion? Yes! No, it's not passion Yes!</i>

00:22:11.833 --> 00:22:14.875
<i>Could it be love? Yes! No, it's not love</i>

00:22:14.875 --> 00:22:22.250
<i>Every time the wind blows, my feelings sway, too</i>

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:28.042
<i>I'm right about that age</i>

00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:35.417
<i>Eyes closed by the poolside, </i>

00:22:35.417 --> 00:22:41.458
<i>I'm the one who's on your mind</i>

00:22:41.458 --> 00:22:47.792
<i>I'd like to graduate from being the girl</i>

00:22:47.792 --> 00:22:53.792
<i>who just follows you around</i>

00:22:53.792 --> 00:23:00.208
<i>If you love me, my summertime lover</i>

00:23:00.208 --> 00:23:07.958
<i>If you love me, my summertime Nancy</i>

00:23:07.958 --> 00:23:14.958
<i>These lips aren't the same as they were last year</i>

00:23:15.583 --> 00:23:18.792
<i>Could it be passion? Yes! No, it's not passion Yes!</i>

00:23:18.792 --> 00:23:21.875
<i>Could it be love? Yes! No, it's not love</i>

00:23:21.875 --> 00:23:29.208
<i>Every time the wind blows, my feelings sway, too</i>

00:23:29.208 --> 00:23:35.250
<i>I'm right about that age</i>

00:23:36.042 --> 00:23:37.292
"Grave of Watermelon"

00:23:37.292 --> 00:23:39.375
<i>Ever since we got back from the beach,</i>

00:23:39.375 --> 00:23:44.667
<i>Ikaros has been making weird</i>
<i>sounds, like she got a little rusty.</i>

00:23:45.375 --> 00:23:47.792
Hey, eat some of this.

00:23:52.292 --> 00:23:54.583
Here is your tea, Master.

00:23:58.583 --> 00:24:01.292
<i>But for some reason, she's better now.</i>

00:24:04.125 --> 00:24:08.128
Next time,
"The Brainy, Heart-pounding Transfer Students"
